"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2026-04-12T00:52:49Z","updated_at":"2026-04-13T05:05:52Z","closed_at":"2026-04-13T01:26:57Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/118443","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118443","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118443.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118443.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"Fixes #118435\n\nThe packed array variant reading code in `resource_format_binary.cpp` read `len` from the file and called `resize(len)` without checking the result. If allocation failed (e.g., extremely large `len` from a malformed `.res` file), `ptrw()` returned null and subsequent `get_buffer()` calls crashed.\n\n**Changes:**\n- Added `ERR_FAIL_COND_V(array.resize(len) != OK, ERR_OUT_OF_MEMORY)` to all 10 packed array cases (byte, int32, int64, float32, float64, string, vector2, vector3, color, vector4).\n- Fixed `get_ustring()` which accessed `&str_buf[0]` on a potentially empty vector when `len == 0`. Now returns an empty `String()` early.","closed_by":{"login":"rayamazaky","id":238893411,"node_id":"U_kgDODj05Yw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/238893411?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rayamazaky","html_url":"https://github.com/rayamazaky","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rayamazaky/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rayamazaky/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rayamazaky/gists{/gist_id}","starred